# EBT requires NO environment variables.
#
# This file exists only to document that fact, so nobody wonders whether a key is missing.
#
# - Circle CCTP: public contracts + public sandbox Iris API (https://iris-api-sandbox.circle.com)
# - Uniswap v3: direct on-chain calls via public testnet RPCs
# - GIWA: OP Stack portal on Ethereum Sepolia
# - Wallet: injected browser wallet, plus WalletConnect QR pairing when enabled
#
# Optional, if you ever add them yourself:
# VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=      # public client identifier, not a secret.
#                                     # Enables the "WalletConnect — QR Code" row (mobile pairing).
#                                     # Free id from https://cloud.reown.com; hidden when empty.
# VITE_SEPOLIA_RPC=                   # override a rate-limited public endpoint
# VITE_BASE_SEPOLIA_RPC=
